BEFORE please extract the DB:

tar -zxvf DB.tgz


This test is discussed on milady webpage. If your test pass please compare your results with OUT_xx files.

OUT_xx are created by the sequence:

cp vacancy.ml_01 vacancy.ml
milady_main.exe  > OUT_01

cp vacancy.ml_02 vacancy.ml
milady_main.exe  > OUT_02

cp vacancy.ml_03 vacancy.ml
milady_main.exe  > OUT_03
